WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.040
Howdy, partners.

2
00:00:01.345 --> 00:00:02.720
Welcome to Dustfall,

3
00:00:02.945 --> 00:00:06.000
where the hats are tall and the alibis are taller.

4
00:00:06.545 --> 00:00:10.000
Grab your phone, scan the code, and join the saloon.

5
00:00:10.585 --> 00:00:12.160
One phone runs the show.

6
00:00:12.785 --> 00:00:14.400
Everybody else gets a secret.

7
00:00:14.905 --> 00:00:16.400
Keep those screens close.
